{"ref":"BDB, פֶּ֫רֶא","hw":"פֶּ֫רֶא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫רֶא</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 39:5\" href=\"/Job.39.5\">Jb 39:5</a></sup> (<strong>m.</strong> et. <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a>, but <strong>f.</strong> prob. erron., cf. Kö<sup>Synt. 157</sup> Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 68</sup>) <strong>wild ass (</strong>prob. from swiftness<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:9\" href=\"/Hosea.8.9\">Ho 8:9</a> + (so <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a> Gi; van d. H. Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּרֶה</span>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:12\" href=\"/Genesis.16.12\">Gn 16:12</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.6\">Je 14:6</a> +;—<em>wild ass</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.6\">Je 14:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:5\" href=\"/Job.6.5\">Jb 6:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 39:5\" href=\"/Job.39.5\">39:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.14\">Is 32:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:11\" href=\"/Psalms.104.11\">ψ 104:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִר פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:12\" href=\"/Job.11.12\">Jb 11:12</a> <em>wild ass’s colt;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ אָדָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:12\" href=\"/Genesis.16.12\">Gn 16:12</a> (J) <em>a wild ass of a man</em> (Ishmael as a free nomad); fig. of wilfulness <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:9\" href=\"/Hosea.8.9\">Ho 8:9</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּדַד\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּדַד\", dir=\"rtl\">I. בָּדַד</a>); of lust <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a> (i.e. Israel’s love of idolatry); of poor desert-dwellers <a data-ref=\"Job 24:5\" href=\"/Job.24.5\">Jb 24:5</a>.","next":"BDB, פִּרְאָם","prev":"BDB, פרא²"}